        "subject": "LU-16518 mdt: remove unused mdt and HSM helpers",
        "message": "LU-16518 mdt: remove unused mdt and HSM helpers\n\n... since they are no longer used. mdt_conn_flags() and\nmdt_req2med() lost their last callers long ago, the HSM debug\nhelper mdt_hsm_dump_hal() has been dead for years, and\nmdt_child_ops() has been unused since it was introduced.\n\nFixes: 8daba6a7381a (\"LU-6047 mdt: remove Size on MDS support\")\nFixes: 9d06de39731a (\"LU-6971 cleanup: not support remote client anymore\")\nFixes: d3003b2a5a71 (\"LU-16518 mdt: fix unused variable compiler warnings\")\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I1a5ca7751e39589951b91b6f84929a145b2867d7\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/69496\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Arshad Hussain <arshad.hussain@aeoncomputing.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: James Simmons <jsimmons@infradead.org>\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
